#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:4
msgid "Уведомление"
msgstr "Notification"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:6
msgid "Содержание"
msgstr "Contents"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:9
msgid "Общее описание"
msgstr "General Description"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:11
msgid ""
"Элемент используется для отправки уведомлений пользователям. На данный "
"момент поддерживается только уведомление по электронной почте."
msgstr ""
"The element is used to send notifications to users. Currently, only email"
" notifications are supported."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:13
msgid ""
"Уведомления отправляются через микросервис ecos-notifications, см. "
"подробнее — :ref:`уведомления <notifications>` и :ref:`шаблоны "
"уведомлений <notification_templates>`."
msgstr ""
"Notifications are sent via the ecos-notifications microservice, see more "
"details — :ref:`notifications <notifications>` and :ref:`notification "
"templates <notification_templates>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:20
msgid "Атрибуты и форма"
msgstr "Attributes and Form"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:23
msgid "Имя и тип уведомления"
msgstr "Name and Notification Type"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:25
msgid ""
"Указать **Имя**, **Тип уведомления** указан по умолчанию **Электронная "
"почта**."
msgstr ""
"Specify **Name**. **Notification type** is set to **Email** by default."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:32
msgid "Шаблон или текст сообщения"
msgstr "Template or Message Text"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:34
msgid ""
"При прямом использовании **Заголовка** и **Тела** возможно указывать "
"только текст, без использования динамических переменных из процесса или "
"документа."
msgstr ""
"When using **Subject** and **Body** directly, only text can be specified,"
" without using dynamic variables from the process or document."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst
msgid "Шаблон уведомления"
msgstr "Notification Template"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:40
msgid "Можно выбрать :ref:`шаблон уведомления <notification_templates>`."
msgstr "You can select a :ref:`notification template <notification_templates>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst
msgid "Заголовок и тело сообщения"
msgstr "Subject and Message Body"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:48
msgid "Или напрямую указать **Заголовок** и **Тело** сообщения."
msgstr "Or directly specify the **Subject** and **Body** of the message."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:55
msgid "Отправка писем-встреч в календарь"
msgstr "Sending Meeting Invitations to the Calendar"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Название** и **Описание** могут быть указаны напрямую или через "
"expression ``${someVariable}``."
msgstr ""
"**Name** and **Description** can be specified directly or via expression "
"``${someVariable}``."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:63
msgid ""
"Настройки события могут быть выбраны как значениями, так и указаны в виде"
" выражений."
msgstr "Event settings can be selected as values or specified as expressions."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst
msgid "Значение"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Организатор** выбирается из ролей, заполненных в :ref:`типе данных "
"<data_types_main>`. Конечным результатом обработки поля будет являться "
"email. Если в роли содержится несколько пользователей, то будет выбран "
"первый вычисленный email."
msgstr ""
"**Organizer** is selected from roles filled in the :ref:`data type "
"<data_types_main>`. The final result of processing the field will be an "
"email. If a role contains multiple users, the first computed email will "
"be selected."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Дата** начала события. При создании события будет указан часовой пояс "
"организатора из профиля пользователя."
msgstr ""
"Event start **Date**. When creating an event, the organizer's timezone "
"from the user profile will be specified."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:73
msgid "**Продолжительность** события выберите из списка."
msgstr "Select event **Duration** from the list."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst
msgid "Выражение"
msgstr "Expression"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Организатор** — имя, recordRef или емейл организатора. Конечным "
"результатом обработки поля будет являться email."
msgstr ""
"**Organizer** — name, recordRef, or organizer's email. The final result "
"of processing the field will be an email."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:83
msgid ""
"Поддерживаются expression для получения данных из переменных или "
"сервисов. Например:"
msgstr ""
"Expressions are supported for obtaining data from variables or services. "
"For example:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:85
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:142
msgid "``ivan.petrov``"
msgstr "``ivan.petrov``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:86
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:143
msgid "``GROUP_company_accountant``"
msgstr "``GROUP_company_accountant``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:87
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:144
msgid "``emodel/authority-group@company_accountant``"
msgstr "``emodel/authority-group@company_accountant``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:88
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:145
msgid "``emodel/person@ivan``"
msgstr "``emodel/person@ivan``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:89
msgid "``ivan.petrov@citeck.ru``"
msgstr "``ivan.petrov@citeck.ru``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:91
msgid ""
"Если передан объект, который содержит несколько емейлов (группа "
"пользователей), то будет выбран первый вычисленный email."
msgstr ""
"If an object containing multiple emails (user group) is passed, the first"
" computed email will be selected."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:93
msgid "**Дата** начала события может быть указана в формате ISO или выражение:"
msgstr "Event start **Date** can be specified in ISO format or as an expression:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:95
msgid "``2020-06-20T10:30:00Z``"
msgstr "``2020-06-20T10:30:00Z``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``${ someDate}``"
msgstr "``${ someDate}``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:98
msgid ""
"Выражение всегда должно возвращать `java.util.Date`, `java.util.String "
"(ISO 8601)` или `null`."
msgstr ""
"The expression must always return `java.util.Date`, `java.util.String "
"(ISO 8601)`, or `null`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:100
msgid ""
"**Продолжительность события** указывается в `ISO 8601 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601>`_ формате. Например:"
msgstr ""
"**Event duration** is specified in `ISO 8601 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601>`_ format. For example:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:102
msgid "PT15S — 15 секунд"
msgstr "PT15S — 15 seconds"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:103
msgid "PT1H30M — 1 час 30 минут"
msgstr "PT1H30M — 1 hour 30 minutes"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:104
msgid "P14D — 14 дней"
msgstr "P14D — 14 days"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Может быть указана напрямую или через expression. Например: "
"``${someVariable}``"
msgstr ""
"Can be specified directly or via expression. For example: "
"``${someVariable}``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:113
msgid "Получатели"
msgstr "Recipients"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:115
msgid ""
"**Получатели** — список получателей уведомления. Получатели могут быть "
"указаны через роли или выражения."
msgstr ""
"**Recipients** — a list of notification recipients. Recipients can be "
"specified via roles or expressions."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:117
msgid "**Стратегия отправки получателям**:"
msgstr "**Recipient Sending Strategy**:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:119
msgid ""
"**Одно письмо всем получателям** — все адреса в поле «Кому». Значение по "
"умолчанию."
msgstr ""
"**One email to all recipients** — all addresses are placed in the \"To\" "
"field. This is the default value."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Отдельное письмо каждому получателю** — каждому адресу в поле «Кому» "
"приходит персональное письмо, получатели не видят друг друга. Применяется"
" только при пустых «Копия» и «Скрытая копия»."
msgstr ""
"**Separate email to each recipient** — each address in the \"To\" field "
"receives a personal email, and recipients do not see each other. Applies "
"only when \"Cc\" and \"Bcc\" are empty."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst
msgid "Роли"
msgstr "Roles"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:130
msgid "**Роли** — роли, заполненные в :ref:`типе данных <data_types_main>`."
msgstr "**Roles** — roles filled in the :ref:`data type <data_types_main>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:138
msgid ""
"**Выражение** — имя, recordRef или емейл получателя. Поддерживаются "
"expression для получения данных из переменных или сервисов. Expression "
"может вернуть множественное значение — строки разделенные запятой: "
"``ivan@mail.com,user2,user3``."
msgstr ""
"**Expression** — name, recordRef, or recipient's email. Expressions are "
"supported for obtaining data from variables or services. The expression "
"can return multiple values — strings separated by commas: "
"``ivan@mail.com,user2,user3``."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:140
msgid "Например:"
msgstr "For example:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:146
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``${someVariable}``"
msgstr "``${someVariable}``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:147
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``${someService.getEmails()},petya.voks``"
msgstr "``${someService.getEmails()},petya.voks``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:154
msgid "Исходящий адрес и дополнительные настройки"
msgstr "From Address and Additional Settings"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:156
msgid ""
"**Исходящий адрес** — исходящий адрес уведомления. Может быть указан "
"напрямую или через expression. Если пусто, то будет использовано значение"
" по умолчанию. Например:"
msgstr ""
"**From address** — the sender address of the notification. Can be "
"specified directly or via expression. If empty, the default value will be"
" used. For example:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:158
msgid "``someAddress@mail.com``"
msgstr "``someAddress@mail.com``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:159
msgid "``\"Some Name\" <someAddress@mail.com>``"
msgstr "``\"Some Name\" <someAddress@mail.com>``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:160
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``${someExpressionToGetAddress}``"
msgstr "``${someExpressionToGetAddress}``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:162
msgid "Получение адреса из Конфигурации Citeck:"
msgstr "Getting address from Citeck Configuration:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:164
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``${Config.getNotNull(\"app/you-app$you-config-key\").asText()}``"
msgstr "``${Config.getNotNull(\"app/you-app$you-config-key\").asText()}``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:166
msgid ""
"**Record уведомления** — базовый record для заполнения шаблона. Если в "
"этом поле ничего не указано, то берется документ, по которому запущен "
"бизнес-процесс."
msgstr ""
"**Notification record** — base record for template population. If nothing"
" is specified in this field, the document on which the business process "
"was started is taken."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:168
msgid ""
"**Язык** — указывается язык шаблона уведомления в формате ``ru``, ``en`` "
"и т.д. Если язык не указан, то берется язык по умолчанию."
msgstr ""
"**Language** — specifies the notification template language in the format"
" ``ru``, ``en``, etc. If no language is specified, the default language "
"is used."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:170
msgid ""
"**Дополнительная модель (additional meta)** — описание дополнительной "
"мета информации, где:"
msgstr ""
"**Additional model (additional meta)** — description of additional meta "
"information, where:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:172
msgid ""
"*ключ (string)* — по ключу становится доступна информация в модели "
"шаблона уведомления."
msgstr ""
"*key (string)* — information becomes available in the notification "
"template model by this key."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:173
msgid ""
"*значение (object)* — если в значении передана строка и начинается с "
"префикса ``!str_``, то символы после префикса записываются как строка, "
"иначе строка считается как recordRef."
msgstr ""
"*value (object)* — if a string is passed as the value and it starts with "
"the prefix ``!str_``, the characters after the prefix are written as a "
"string; otherwise, the string is considered a recordRef."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:181
msgid ""
"При сохранении, сохранении/публикации процесса проверяется обязательность"
" заполнения следующих полей:"
msgstr ""
"When saving, saving/publishing the process, the mandatory filling of the "
"following fields is checked:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:183
msgid "**«Шаблон»** или **«Тело сообщения»**;"
msgstr "**«Template»** or **«Message Body»**;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:184
msgid "**«Получатели»** (Роли или Выражение)."
msgstr "**«Recipients»** (Roles or Expression)."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:186
msgid "Иначе в :ref:`линтере <bpmn_linter>` будет выдана ошибка."
msgstr "Otherwise, an error will be issued in the :ref:`linter <bpmn_linter>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:191
msgid "Доступные переменные"
msgstr "Available Variables"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:193
msgid "В модели шаблона уведомлений есть доступ к следующим переменным:"
msgstr "The notification template model has access to the following variables:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:195
msgid ""
"*Переменные из базового record*. По умолчанию это документ, по которому "
"идет бизнес-процесс. Обращение происходит напрямую к атрибутам record."
msgstr ""
"*Variables from the base record*. By default, this is the document on "
"which the business process is running. Access is directly to the record's"
" attributes."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:196
msgid ""
"*Переменные процесса.* Через переменную ``$process`` доступны переменные "
"процесса на момент отправки уведомления."
msgstr ""
"*Process variables.* Through the ``$process`` variable, process variables"
" at the time of sending the notification are available."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:197
msgid ""
"*Переменные* :ref:`событий Citeck <ecos_bpmn_events>`. Доступны через "
"переменную ``$process.event``."
msgstr ""
"*Variables* of :ref:`Citeck events <ecos_bpmn_events>`. Available via the"
" ``$process.event`` variable."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:198
msgid "*Контекстные переменные Records API*"
msgstr "*Records API Context Variables*"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:200
msgid ""
"Также в самом шаблоне уведомлений доступны :ref:`сервисы шаблонизатора "
"<notification_template_services>`."
msgstr ""
"Also available within the notification template itself are "
":ref:`templating services <notification_template_services>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:203
msgid "Пример использования переменных в шаблоне"
msgstr "Example of using variables in a template"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:205
msgid ""
"Для примера используем **event sub process**, который реагирует на "
"событие добавления нового комментария и отправляет уведомление."
msgstr ""
"For example, we use an **event sub process** that reacts to the event of "
"adding a new comment and sends a notification."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:211
msgid "Шаблон уведомления содержит модель:"
msgstr "The notification template contains the model:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_notifications.rst:231
msgid "Шаблон уведомления содержит текст:"
